factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The slides_spec title 'என்ன நடந்தது?' slide line says 'மனுவை விவசாயிகள் கூட்டமைப்புத் தலைவர் ராமசாமி தலைமையிலான' which is a broken, incomplete sentence with no clear meaning in Tamil.
  The reel_script says the petition was given to the Collector by farmers led by Ramasamy, Periyasamy and Ponnaiyan, but the article says it was led by Ramasamy, Periyasamy and Ponnaiyan together; this is a minor attribution wording issue, and the reel_script omits that the Collector is named Kandasamy only in some places (acceptable), so this item is not a problem.
  The caption says the petition was filed 'ஆகஸ்ட் 15ஆம் தேதி' in a way that mixes the date of water not being released with the petition context; the article says water could not be released on Aug 15, which is accurately reflected, so no problem here.
  The reel_script states 'வடகிழக்கு பருவமழை நம்பிக்கை அளிப்பதாக உள்ளது' but the sentence about the Aug 15 water release and the monsoon failure are presented sequentially; the key cause (failure of southwest monsoon) is accurately stated, so no problem.
  The slides_spec 'ஏன் முக்கியம்?' slide and the reel_script do not clearly separate the two different requests (dry-crop irrigation from Dec 15 to Mar 31 and the special wetting irrigation), and the slide line 'சிறப்பு நனைப்புக்கும் நீர் வழங்க வேண்டும்' under 'என்ன கோரிக்கை?' is accurate; however the caption's final English line 'Erode Kizhbhavani farmers petition Collector for dry-crop irrigation water' is not a problem per the rules.
